### 0a. API Gateway Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 0b. Phrase Service Health Check
GET http://localhost:8002/health

### 0c. Sentiment Service Health Check
GET http://localhost:8003/health

### 0d. Score Service Health Check
GET http://localhost:8004/health

### 1a. Process Direct Text Message
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I am extremely hello unhappy and I want to cancel my account immediately."
}

### 1b. Process Direct Text Message (Agent Response)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I completely understand your concern and I am happy to help resolve this for you right away.",
  "speaker": "agent"
}

### 1c. Process Message with Previous Score
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I am extremely angry and furious about this issue!",
  "speaker": "caller",
  "previous_score": -60.0
}

### 2a. Add Single Monitored Keyword with Category via API Gateway (PostgreSQL)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/add-keyword
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "cancel account",
  "category": "churn"
}

### 2b. Add Single Monitored Keyword without Category (Defaults to NULL)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/add-keyword
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "Bad"
}

### 2c. Add Multiple Monitored Keywords with Specific Categories in Batch
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/add-keyword
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keywords": [
    { "keyword": "refund", "category": "billing" },
    { "keyword": "billing dispute", "category": "billing" },
    { "keyword": "lawyer", "category": "compliance" },
    { "keyword": "talk to supervisor" }
  ]
}

### 2d. Add Multiple Monitored Keywords with Common Category
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/add-keyword
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "satisfaction",
  "keywords": [
    "great job",
    "thank you",
    "excellent service"
  ]
}

### 2e. Get All Monitored Keywords via API Gateway (PostgreSQL)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin-keywords

### 2f. Delete a Monitored Keyword via API Gateway (PostgreSQL)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/delete-keyword/cancel%20account

### 2g. Direct Phrase Service - Get Keywords
GET http://localhost:8002/admin-keywords

### 2h. Direct Phrase Service - Extract Keywords in Text
POST http://localhost:8002/extract-keywords
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I want to cancel my account and demand a refund because of unacceptable service."
}

### 3a. Analyze Single Sentence Sentiment
POST http://localhost:8003/analyze-sentiment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Thank you so much for your quick and wonderful support!"
}

### 3b. Analyze Batch Sentences Sentiment
POST http://localhost:8003/analyze-sentiment-batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "This service is terrible and completely unacceptable."
    },
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "I appreciate your help in resolving my billing problem."
    },
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "My customer ID number is 98765."
    }
  ]
}

### 4a. Calculate Score (Standard Defaults)
POST http://localhost:8004/calculate-score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emotion": "anger",
  "confidence": 0.80,
  "previous_score": -55.0
}

### 4b. Calculate Score (Positive Domain Step)
POST http://localhost:8004/calculate-score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emotion": "gratitude",
  "confidence": 0.95,
  "previous_score": 85.0
}
